# Results: keep the small summary files (CSV, TXT, MD) of every run, not its raw logs (several GB).
**/results/**/logs/
**/results/*/*.log
**/results/*/cp-*/
**/results/*/.*
**/results/smoke*/
**/results/aborted-*/
# the rogue-node and pool logs of the outsider runs are small and are the evidence: keep them
!**/outsider/results/*/*.log
